---
description: Model capability constraints for this project
alwaysApply: true
---

This project may be run with a text-only model with no image/vision
support. Never use the Read/view tool on .png/.jpg/.gif files under any
circumstances, even to "verify" a screenshot. Verify UI changes only by
checking rendered HTML/DOM via Playwright assertions (expected text,
element counts, computed styles) and by confirming a screenshot file was
written successfully (exists, non-zero size, via ls). If genuine visual
verification is required (e.g. checking layout/spacing that can't be
asserted via the DOM), stop and ask the user to switch to a vision-capable
model — do not attempt to read the image yourself.